Coin icons from the open-source set spothq/cryptocurrency-icons.
https://github.com/spothq/cryptocurrency-icons

Files eth.svg, usdt.svg, trx.svg, and bnb.svg are the colour SVGs
(svg/color/<ticker>.svg) from that repository.

